aimap
*.json
dist/
*.db

# Live-scan / recon artifacts — never commit harvested target data.
# Enforced alongside the pre-push data-leak gate. These match scan output
# only; no tracked source file matches any pattern below (verified).
#
# Per-host recon dirs named after an IPv4 (e.g. 108_136_62_125/) — hold
# whois/rdns/shodan/greynoise/passive-dns dumps for live targets.
[0-9]*_[0-9]*_[0-9]*_[0-9]*/
# Default scan-output tree (reports/, ndjson, etc.).
output/
# Harvested data formats that the *.json glob above does not cover.
*.ndjson
# Ad-hoc one-off probe scripts dropped at the repo root during a scan.
*_probe*.py
*probe*.py
